WEBVTT

00:00:03.178 --> 00:00:07.886
Open Settings, Artificial Intelligence, and find the Documents section.

00:00:07.886 --> 00:00:12.533
The Index profile is the documents index that stores every attachment.

00:00:12.533 --> 00:00:16.018
Once people use it, avoid switching to another one.

00:00:16.536 --> 00:00:19.437
Document retrieval mode is the site default.

00:00:19.437 --> 00:00:22.861
Chunk gives the assistant only the matching passages.

00:00:22.861 --> 00:00:26.516
Hierarchical gives it the whole documents they come from.

00:00:26.982 --> 00:00:32.599
Allow document uploads in chat interactions and Allow image uploads in chat interactions

00:00:32.599 --> 00:00:36.542
turn attachments on or off for the Chat Interactions screen.

00:00:36.542 --> 00:00:38.932
Pictures need a vision deployment.

00:00:39.387 --> 00:00:45.769
Largest document that can be indexed is the most characters of text one document may have.

00:00:45.769 --> 00:00:47.497
Zero means no limit.

00:00:47.976 --> 00:00:53.686
Describe figures in uploaded documents decides whether charts and pictures are described.

00:00:53.686 --> 00:00:57.714
It uses a vision model and costs more, so it is the expensive

00:00:57.714 --> 00:00:59.156
part of an upload.

00:00:59.611 --> 00:01:05.578
The vision model is the Default vision deployment, in the Deployments section of the same page.

00:01:05.578 --> 00:01:07.941
Without one, nothing is described.

